#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Function FIB calculates the Nth term of a Fibonacci sequence (1, 1, 2, 3, 5, 8, "
"13, 21...), in which each number, after the first two, is the sum of the two "
"numbers immediately preceding it. @FIB(0) is defined to be 0."
